    <desc>A single PhoneNumber (contract path /phone-numbers/{phoneNumberId}/index, GET only). Identify the number with the "phoneNumberId" query argument. PhoneNumbers are nested property values, not container members, so this is a flat resource path in the contract and stays one here. Backing record is a native CiviCRM Phone.</desc>
